{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/extras/ef741f1f2ebcbaa806ca38a77b07c143.poster.avif?t=1757221001\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/extras/ef741f1f2ebcbaa806ca38a77b07c143.webm?t=1757221001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/extras/ef741f1f2ebcbaa806ca38a77b07c143.mp4?t=1757221001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Flaurel Gerania el Caryana.</strong> She\u2019s my character, but she\u2019s also a piece of me. This game is your chance to see the world through her eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you\u2019ll do:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill with a cozy slice-of-life story about the little things that matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a few easy mini-games to keep things fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Flaurel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re into anime-style visual novels or just curious about who Flaurel really is, I hope you enjoy hanging out with her as much as I enjoyed bringing her to life. Thanks for playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/extras/273c7113e6cf0a8c149a973415e24933.avif?t=1757221001\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913990?t=1757221001","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/